{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國股市個別發展，納斯達克指數回軟。道瓊斯工業平均指數，早段升約300點。</p><p></p><p>納指未能承接上日升勢，早段下跌約180點。科技股普遍受壓，戴爾電腦未止跌，再跌約百分之3。晶片股美光科技和閃迪，曾跌約百分之3。蘋果公司推出新款手機，股價早段升逾百分之1，曾升至347美元水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T14:59:03.703366+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T20:17:50.281942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T14:57:38.481712+00:00","content_hash":"633a37ef6f8ab90ca2f4728d714c1022e711cc16ad2332e3248c5cfea33d200d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}